WEBVTT

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:02.720
of generations of people

00:19:03.880 --> 00:19:07.456
who believed in the promise of America

00:19:07.480 --> 00:19:11.920
and had the faith to upbuild democracy?

00:19:16.760 --> 00:19:21.416
Do you want to live
into the fullest of your potential?

00:19:21.440 --> 00:19:23.016
I certainly do.

00:19:23.040 --> 00:19:24.760
And I believe you do, too.

00:19:27.920 --> 00:19:32.056
Let me just say, quite seriously,